ar they did not have them unite  at the end  it ended with pretty much cap winning  and the avengers falling apart however  that was definitely to  set up the events of infinity war so i  think black panther 2  if namor truly is in the movie which it  seems like at this point we have a ton  of evidence that says  yes he will be i think it'll be a good  combination of captain america civil war  and batman vs superman  but either way it's exciting because  neymar is actually a mutant  so if he truly is coming which it really  does seem like he is  that means more mutants are coming to  the mcu which of course  is what we are all waiting for until we  get that x-men film  but in the meantime let me know what you  think about this news in the comments  down below the tribute to king t'challa  in black panther 2 and the approach  of namor don't forget to subscribe and  click the notification bell if you want  to stay up to date on all things mcu  don't forget to like the video and for  live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof

